## 5. Business Requirements

### BR1: User Account & Identity Management

* **BR1.1:** The system shall enable users to register, authenticate, and manage profiles based on assigned roles (Student, Vendor, Administrator).
* **BR1.2:** The system shall enforce student verification via university ID credentials to restrict student discounts exclusively to eligible users.
* **BR1.3:** The system shall enable administrators to review, approve, suspend, or deactivate user and vendor accounts.

### BR2: Vendor & Catalog Management

* **BR2.1:** The system shall allow registered vendors to create, update, and manage business profiles and product catalogs.
* **BR2.2:** The system shall support multi-category product listings (Traditional, Formal, University Ceremony Wear, Accessories, and Package Offers) with custom pricing for both rental and direct purchase options.
* **BR2.3:** The system shall dynamically update and track vendor inventory quantities to reflect active rentals, sales, and reserved stock.

### BR3: Product Discovery & Marketplace Operations

* **BR3.1:** The system shall allow students to search, filter, and compare products based on category, price, size, vendor, and availability type (rental vs. purchase).
* **BR3.2:** The system shall process reservation requests by verifying real-time product availability for selected rental date windows to eliminate double-booking.

### BR4: Order Fulfillment & Financial Transactions

* **BR4.1:** The system shall process online payments securely for purchases and rentals through integrated payment gateways.
* **BR4.2:** The system shall automatically calculate order totals, apply verified student discounts, and issue downloadable digital receipts/invoices.
* **BR4.3:** The system shall support a structured rental return workflow, allowing vendors to confirm item returns, assess item condition, and release updated inventory back to the active catalog.

### BR5: Communication & Platform Governance

* **BR5.1:** The system shall send automated notifications (in-app and email) to users regarding reservation updates, payment status, return reminders, and vendor approvals.
* **BR5.2:** The system shall allow students to submit ratings and reviews for products and vendors following completed transactions.
* **BR5.3:** The system shall provide business reporting dashboards for vendors (sales, rental performance, revenue summaries) and administrators (total transactions, active users, platform growth).

